      "cooked": "<p>Who could hate this guy enough to be a foe?</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-291-creative-process-benchmark-foes\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-291-creative-process-benchmark-foes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/ca864864fd4764e914bcab3670be2db68d1c0662.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/episode-291-creative-process-benchmark-foes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Letters Page: Episode #291 - Creative Process: Benchmark Foes</a></h3>\n\n  <p>It's the first Creative Process in a long time! Will this become some sort of new standard?! Show Notes: Run Time: 2:03:36 This is the first of two episodes we recorded in one day, and we inteded to go through it (and next week's episode) quickly to...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n",
