      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/ba8739/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2024-09-01T12:03:09.917Z",
      "cooked": "<p>According to the wiki from Young Legacy episode:</p>\n<p>Justice Comics <span class=\"hashtag\">#687</span> August 2012 - leaves for college<br>\nYear of backup stories in JC<br>\nAmerica’s Finest Legacy <span class=\"hashtag\">#498</span> - last headline for Paul VIII<br>\nAmerica’s Greatest Legacy <span class=\"hashtag\">#499</span> August 2013 - retrospective on Paul VII<br>\nAmerica’s Newest Legacy <span class=\"hashtag\">#500</span> - Felicia’s book, in college until end of Multiverse at end of 2016<br>\n~40 issues with last quarter being more OblivAeon than college</p>",
      "post_number": 13,
